  #line-at(90.024pt, 661.42pt, "magnetization configuration becomes parallel with the increasing of fields. Similar to ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 677.02pt, "the giant magnetoresistance (GMR) effect observed in antiferromagnetic spin valve ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 692.62pt, "systems, the transition between the two configurations leads to the plateau-like shape ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 708.22pt, "in the MR responses.")
