  #line-at(251.81pt, 614.62pt, "). It decreases with the raising of temperature. The ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 630.22pt, "thermal vibration of lattices could cause more spin-dependent scattering and then ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 645.82pt, "suppress the magnetic response of the zGNR device. ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 677.02pt, "Similar magnetoresistance responses are observed in three different samples with ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 692.62pt, "comparable coercive field values. Such hysteretic behaviors are the hallmarks of ")
