  #line-at(90.024pt, 130.94pt, "FC and ZFC curves display a monotonic decrease of the magnetization with the ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 146.54pt, "increasing temperature. Combined with the fact that the apparent hysteresis loop ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 162.14pt, "behavior can be observed in ")
